--     the trigger graph was followed to CLOSURE (80550, 99995, 100040, 97246,
--     100264, 98002, 100855, 100262).  The only remaining leaves are 45334 and
--     50286, both stock and already present client-side.
--   * 76651 "Increased Mod Detected Range" -- the benign creature_addon aura on
--     52289 Fiery Behemoth, safe to restore.
--
-- No EffectMiscValue remap was needed: none of these carry SUMMON / KILL_CREDIT
-- / TRANSFORM effects (checked effects 28/90/134 and auras 56/78).
