-- !! DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED: spell 84886, the second creature_addon aura in this
-- layer (on 53056 Shalis Darkhunter).  The Cata Spell.dbc names it "Generic
-- Quest Invisibility 9" -- retail campaign-stage gating, the same family as
-- 87872 / 94223 / 80797 (see 15_'s header).  On DC's fully-unlocked snapshot
-- there is no paired detection grant, so applying it would make the NPC
-- INVISIBLE TO EVERY PLAYER -- the 2026-07-26 Hyjal questgiver-invisibility
-- defect all over again.  Do not "restore" it.  ALWAYS read the Cata spell NAME
-- before restoring a dropped addon aura.
--
-- Server-side only, per the standing precedent for NPC-cast spells (the client
-- renders them from its own Spell.dbc; matching client rows are available in
-- k:/tmp/hyjal_r24/hyjal_r24_spells.csv if visuals ever need them).
-- Verified before shipping: all 33 ids absent from live spell_dbc (0 dupes).
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

